{"title":"Meta-papers in science (from my email)","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/955971524/0/marginalrevolution~Metapapers-in-science-from-my-email.html","date":1778784098000,"content":"<p>From Brennan Plaetzer:</p>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n<p>Hi Tyler,</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/will-ai-kill-the-research-paper.html\" target=\"_blank\">Your post yesterday</a> argued AI will replace papers with meta-papers that synthesize, re-run, and extend prior work. I built one in oncology last month, before reading your post.</p>\r\n<p>I ran my friend Omar Abdel-Wahab’s (MSK) last ten papers through an AI synthesis layer. This came out on top: an integrated, falsifiable hypothesis bridging two of his 2025 papers, one in <em>Cancer Cell</em> on a refractory MEK1 mutation, one in <em>Cell</em> on splicing-derived neoantigens. It comes with seven testable experiments his lab can run today. The move generalizes to any field: surface the questions hidden in plain view, the ones the source papers could answer with their own data but never asked.</p>\r\n<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://nam11.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=https%3A%2F%2Fpage56capital.com%2Fwritings%2Fcross-paper-synthesis&amp;data=05%7C02%7Ctcowen%40gmu.edu%7C8c0ba6bfcc1e4f13b93f08deafcebb0e%7C9e857255df574c47a0c00546460380cb%7C0%7C0%7C639141499684836541%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=Dv9nJVjgBTdQsV8UsvNc7tQJ4SSJshm64DmFawFDY3o%3D&amp;reserved=0\" target=\"_blank\">https://page56capital.com/writings/cross-paper-synthesis</a></p>\r\n<p>The “box” you described already exists in biology. It just doesn’t have a name there yet.</p>\r\n<p>Brennan</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Note that if you, in the future, do not do this kind of thing yourself, someone else, or their AI agent, will do it for you.  Solve for the equilibrium!</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/meta-papers-in-science-from-my-email.html\">Meta-papers in science (from my email)</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/955971524/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/955971524/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/955971524/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/955971524/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/955971524/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/955971524/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/meta-papers-in-science-from-my-email.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/meta-papers-in-science-from-my-email.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/meta-papers-in-science-from-my-email.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/meta-papers-in-science-from-my-email.html#comment-161044388\">In reply